                           SPACING                                                                                      
                                                                                                                        
                           space-1         4pt        icon to label                                                     
                           space-2         8pt         items in a row                                                   
                           space-3         12pt         pane inset                                                      
                           space-4         16pt          groups in a pane                                               
                           space-5         24pt            sections                                                     
                           space-6         32pt              page margins                                               
                                                                                                                        
                           SIZES                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                           row             24pt            list, tree and tab rows                                      
                           control         28pt             buttons, fields                                             
                           bar             36pt               pane headers, tab strips                                  
                           header          44pt                 the window header                                       
                           icon            16pt          icons in rows                                                  
                                                                                                                        
                           RADIUS AND STROKES                                                                           
                                                                                                                        
                           radius-sm       4pt        rows, tabs, badges                                                
                           radius-md       6pt        controls                                                          
                           radius-lg       10pt        popovers                                                         
                           divider         1pt        separators                                                        
                           focus           2pt        the focus ring                                                    
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        